      "short": "$\\frac{1}{3}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{triangle}) &= \\frac{\\text{Triangle Area}}{\\text{Square Area}} \\\\ P(\\text{triangle}) &= \\frac{\\frac{(4)(6)}{2}}{6^2} \\\\ P(\\text{triangle}) &= \\frac{12}{36} \\\\ P(\\text{triangle}) &= \\frac{1}{3}.\\end{align*}$$",
